==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle, spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]s to defend and a few [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]]. Use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to slowly damage THE SLOTHs. A [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance attacker]] such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] can be used to wear down THE SLOTHs from afar.

