==Trivia==
*Tactical War Tuna's Japanese name, Saishū Heiki Toro (最終兵器トロ, "Ultimate Weapon Toro"), may be a reference to ''Saishū Heiki Kanojo'' (最終兵器彼女, "She, the Ultimate Weapon"), the Japanese name of the manga [[wikipedia:Saikano|''Saikano'']].
**''Toro'' is the fatty part of a tuna used as an ingredient in sushi.

